$ enola upgrade --help
exit: 2
--- stdout
--- stderr
Usage: enola upgrade

Download and install the latest enola release, replacing the running
binary in place. A dev build is always treated as out of date. An
install managed by a package manager (pip, for one) is left alone, with
the command that upgrades it instead.

Exit codes:
  0  upgraded, already current, or left to the package manager
  1  the upgrade failed
